"brings <code>claude --resume</code> up in a tmux window — from the "
"directory the session started in, so the project context stays the same. "
"The terminal window goes dark, the history survives.\n"
"A terminal session's stdin cannot be reached from outside, so a clean "
"<code>/exit</code> is impossible here — which is exactly why the signal "
"is needed."

